摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"一个可以让ai自动调用VLM(多模态模型)进行视觉分析的dsh插件。A dsh plugin that allows AI to automatically invoke VLMs (multimodal models) for visual analysis.","id":"gh:1333516562","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-her-eyes","slug":"huashenglian/dsh-her-eyes","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"一个可以让ai自动调用VLM(多模态模型)进行视觉分析的dsh插件。A dsh plugin that allows AI to automatically invoke VLMs (multimod"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"al models) for visual analysis."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-her-eyes"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A Vision-Language-Model (VLM) analyzer plugin for **DeepSeek Harness** (`dsh`). It gives the AI an `"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"analyze_image` tool backed by primary/backup OpenAI-compatible vision endpoints with automatic failo"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ver, and adds an auto-saving **Settings → Vision Models (VLM)** page (English/中文)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **`analyze_image` tool** registered on the global tools registry — available in every session.\n- *"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"*Primary / backup VLM APIs** — OpenAI-compatible `endpoint` + `apiKey` + `model`; if the primary fai"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ls consecutively beyond the retry count, the AI automatically falls back to the backup.\n- **Auto-sav"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ing settings page** — every edit saves and takes effect immediately; no Save button. Also lets you f"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"etch the model list from the endpoint.\n- **Web routes** `/vlm/config`, `/vlm/models`, `/vlm/reset` s"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"erved by the host half.\n- **i18n** — the settings page follows the harness UI language (English / 中文"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ved by the host half.\n- **i18n** — the settings page follows the harness UI language (English / 中文)."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- `dsh` CLI (DeepSeek Harness) with a `web` profile installed. Requires `pnpm` on `PATH` (or use `np"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"x --yes pnpm@<version>`)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The plugin is a **bundle**: it carries its own `cordis.patch.yml` and self-activates. Installing it "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"is a single command — no manual patch editing in the profile."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"`dsh plugin add` installs the dependency and appends the bundle to `dsh.profile.bundles` automatical"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"h plugin add` installs the dependency and appends the bundle to `dsh.profile.bundles` automatically."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> If `pnpm` is not on `PATH`, run the equivalent manually:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> then add `\"dsh-her-eyes\"` to the `dsh.profile.bundles` array in `package.json`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Manual placement (alternative)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Put the package under `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/plugins/dsh-her-eyes/`.\n2. Add `\"dsh-her-eyes\": \"fi"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"le:./plugins/dsh-her-eyes\"` to the profile `package.json` `dependencies`.\n3. Add `\"dsh-her-eyes\"` to"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" the profile `dsh.profile.bundles` array.\n4. Run `pnpm install` (or `npx --yes pnpm@11.7.0 install`)"},{"id":"p16s4","text":", then restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Do **not** add a manual `- insert: - id: her-eyes` row to the profile `cordis.patch.yml` — the bundl"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e already inserts it. A second insert would throw `duplicate loader entry id: her-eyes` at boot."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"All configuration lives in one JSON file: **`$DSH_HOME/vlm-vision.json`** (default `~/.dsh/vlm-visio"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"guration lives in one JSON file: **`$DSH_HOME/vlm-vision.json`** (default `~/.dsh/vlm-vision.json`)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `endpoint` — OpenAI-compatible base (e.g. `https://api.openai.com/v1`) or the full `…/chat/complet"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ions` URL.\n- `apiKey` — leave the key empty in the file; it is saved via the settings page and store"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"d masked.\n- `retryCount` — after this many consecutive failures of one API, the active API switches "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ount` — after this many consecutive failures of one API, the active API switches (primary ⇄ backup)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"You can edit the file directly, or use the settings page (all edits auto-save)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The package is **dual-face**:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- **Host half** (`lib/index.js`) — a cordis plugin. Registers the `analyze_image` tool on the global"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" tools registry and the `/vlm/config|models|reset` routes on the web server. Loads and persists `vlm"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"-vision.json`.\n- **Client half** (`lib/client.js`) — the browser module, loaded via `__ModuleLoader_"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"_` because the package declares `dsh.client`. Registers a **Settings → Vision Models (VLM)** section"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" (list slot `settings.section`, id `vlm-vision`, order 40) and the locale namespace `settings.her-ey"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"st slot `settings.section`, id `vlm-vision`, order 40) and the locale namespace `settings.her-eyes`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The bundle `cordis.patch.yml` inserts the `her-eyes` entry that activates both halves."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Coexistence with other plugins"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"This plugin is built to play nicely with other frontend plugins that touch the settings window:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Resource | Value | Notes |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Loader entry id | `her-eyes` | unique across the harness |\n| Settings slot id | `vlm-vision` | the"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" `settings.section` slot is a **list** — multiple sections coexist; only the same `id` would conflic"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"t |\n| Locale namespace | `settings.her-eyes` | namespaced by plugin |\n| Tool name | `analyze_image` "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"| unique |\n| Web routes | `/vlm/*` | unique path prefix |\n| CSS classes | `vlm-*` | global styles, p"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"refixed to avoid collisions |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The harness itself enforces uniqueness (duplicate loader ids, slot ids, tool names, or routes throw "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"and fail loudly) — so two plugins never silently shadow each other."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"This removes the dependency and the bundle entry. Your `vlm-vision.json` config file is left untouch"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"s removes the dependency and the bundle entry. Your `vlm-vision.json` config file is left untouched."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
